Package: softcellcomm
Title: Soft Cell-Cell Communication Scoring Using CellWalker Identity Probabilities
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extends CellWalker/CellWalkR's probabilistic cell-type diffusion
    scores into ligand-receptor communication analysis. Instead of assigning
    each cell a single hard cell-type label before computing communication
    scores (as CellChat/LIANA/CellPhoneDB do), this package uses CellWalker's
    full per-cell probability distribution over cell types as a weighting
    scheme, producing continuous, identity-uncertainty-aware communication
    networks. Applied here to a tumor microenvironment scRNA-seq dataset
    with a known partial-EMT population as a validation case.
